# Controller Audit Log Fields

When logging controller actions (`*Action`) in `api/**/*.go`, include contextual IDs to keep logs traceable.

Use the IDs that are available in that handler:

- `workspaceID` when the action is workspace-scoped
- `userID` for authenticated actions
- Entity IDs relevant to the operation (for example `gitCredID`, `keyID`, `taskID`)

Apply this to both success and error logs for create/update/delete/read flows.

Example:

```go
log.Info().
	Str("gitCredID", idStr).
	Str("workspaceID", workspaceIDStr).
	Str("userID", user.ID.String()).
	Msg("Git credentials deleted successfully")
```
